<article class="env-lemma" id="03K5">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/03K5">Lemma <span data-tag="03K5">68.12.1</span>.</a> Let $S$ be a scheme. Let $X$ be a decent algebraic space over $S$. Let $U \to X$ be an étale morphism from a scheme to $X$. If $u, u' \in |U|$ map to the same point of $|X|$, and $u' \leadsto u$, then $u = u'$. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Combine Lemmas <a href="/tag/03JX" data-tag="03JX">68.5.1</a> and <a href="/tag/03IM" data-tag="03IM">68.7.1</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>